  "511:y newyddion": "source newyddion + untiled y",
  "512:nôl y goriadau": "source dw i’n nôl y goriadau; taught dw i’n (2 frame) + the verb unit",
  "513:symud fy mhen": "source fy mhen; symud is taught as 이사하다 (506), so move-the-head one unit",
  "513:i fyny ac i lawr": "source i fyny + ac i lawr; Korean 위아래로 one unit",
  "514:wnes i ffeindio’r": "untiled; frame like wnes i wylio (221)",
  "515:ar ddiwrnod cynta’": "source ar + untiled ddiwrnod cynta’; Korean ~의 첫날에 one unit",
  "518:fyswn i ddim yn medru": "kept source; 나는 ~ㄹ 수 없을 거야 is taken by fydda i ddim yn medru (157), so 텐데",
  "520:i’r teulu cyfan": "source teulu cyfan + untiled i’r",
  "521:y byddi di’n": "kept source; 네가 ~ㄹ 거라고 is taken by bo’ ti’n mynd i (509), so the seed’s ~ㄹ까 봐",
  "521:anghofio": "untiled",
  "521:aros yn fan hyn": "source yn fan hyn; aros is taught as 기다리다 (475), so stay-here one unit",
  "522:gadewch i ni": "source gadewch i ni gytuno; taught gadewch i ni (158) + gytuno",
  "524:tri neu bedwar munud": "source mewn tri neu bedwar munud is 9 syllables over the cap; taught mewn (253) + the number unit",
  "528:mewn ystafell arall": "source mewn + untiled ystafell arall; Korean 다른 방에 one unit",
  "529:roi eich dwylo i fyny": "source roi + eich dwylo + i fyny; roi is taught as 넣다, Korean 손을 들다 one unit",
  "530:fel medra i": "fel untiled; frame like fel medra i gofio (56)",
  "531:bod unrhyw un yn medru": "source unrhyw un + untiled bod, yn; one clause unit",
  "531:y gêm": "source gêm + untiled y",
  "534:yn y tywydd ofnadwy yma": "source tywydd ofnadwy + untiled yn, y; yma here means this, not 여기에 (plan), so one unit",
  "535:mi wnaeth o addewid": "source addewid + untiled mi wnaeth o; Korean 약속했어 one unit",
  "535:y swydd": "source swydd + untiled y",
  "536:bod bod yn wallgof": "source bod yn wallgof + untiled bod",
